{
"description":"The activities (docs/spec/activity.md). Each case of tabs gives a tab, its plugin and its statuses that declare activity, each as {name, value} with the value that the surface of the tab reports (absent when the surface has not registered the status), and returns {activity, error}: the activity of the tab, or null, and the text of the error that a value that is neither an activity nor null shows (docs/spec/activity.md#activity-of-a-tab), or null. Each case of windows gives the projects of a window, each {id, spaces} with the layouts of its spaces in the stored form (docs/spec/groups.md#storage), and the activity of each tab that has one, and returns {spaces, tabs}: for each project that has a space with an activity the activities of its spaces, each {activity, cards, groups}, which the window publishes with projectActivity, and the activities of the tabs, each listed only with an activity (docs/spec/activity.md#activity-of-a-card-a-group-card-and-a-space). Each case of records gives steps on the project activity record of the host (docs/spec/activity.md#activity-of-a-project), each one of publish {window, owner, id, spaces}, where window is the window that publishes and owner the window that holds the project or null, release {id} and end {window}, with error, the text of the refusal of a publication or null, and record, the record {revision, projects} after the step.",
"tabs":[
 {"name":"a value that is an activity gives that activity","plugin":"probe","tab":"t1","statuses":[{"name":"probe.s","value":"running"}],"returns":{"activity":"running","error":null}},
 {"name":"a null value gives no activity","plugin":"probe","tab":"t1","statuses":[{"name":"probe.s","value":null}],"returns":{"activity":null,"error":null}},
 {"name":"a status that the surface has not registered gives no activity","plugin":"probe","tab":"t1","statuses":[{"name":"probe.s"}],"returns":{"activity":null,"error":null}},
 {"name":"a tab without statuses that declare activity has no activity","plugin":"probe","tab":"t1","statuses":[],"returns":{"activity":null,"error":null}},
 {"name":"the highest activity of the statuses of a tab is its activity","plugin":"probe","tab":"t1","statuses":[{"name":"probe.a","value":"idle"},{"name":"probe.b","value":"attention"},{"name":"probe.c","value":"failed"}],"returns":{"activity":"attention","error":null}},
 {"name":"failed stands above running and idle","plugin":"probe","tab":"t1","statuses":[{"name":"probe.a","value":"running"},{"name":"probe.b","value":"failed"},{"name":"probe.c","value":"idle"}],"returns":{"activity":"failed","error":null}},
 {"name":"running stands above idle","plugin":"probe","tab":"t1","statuses":[{"name":"probe.a","value":"idle"},{"name":"probe.b","value":"running"}],"returns":{"activity":"running","error":null}},
 {"name":"a string that is no activity gives none and is an error that names the plugin, the status and the value","plugin":"probe","tab":"t1","statuses":[{"name":"probe.s","value":"busy"}],"returns":{"activity":null,"error":"probe exposes probe.s on tab t1: activity value \"busy\" is not one of attention, failed, running, idle"}},
 {"name":"a value that is not a string is an error","plugin":"probe","tab":"t1","statuses":[{"name":"probe.s","value":{"busy":true}}],"returns":{"activity":null,"error":"probe exposes probe.s on tab t1: activity value {\"busy\":true} is not one of attention, failed, running, idle"}},
 {"name":"a status with a wrong value leaves the activities of the other statuses, and the first wrong status in the order of the statuses is the error","plugin":"probe","tab":"t1","statuses":[{"name":"probe.a","value":"running"},{"name":"probe.b","value":"Running"},{"name":"probe.c","value":3}],"returns":{"activity":"running","error":"probe exposes probe.b on tab t1: activity value \"Running\" is not one of attention, failed, running, idle"}}
